on-discipline-used-during-development","content":"Pure bash `scripts/ci_check_only.sh` (no Bazel cold start)"},"117":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-115","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#validation-discipline-used-during-development","content":"**Path filter notes:** `scripts/**` no longer always runs docs — only `scripts/manage.sh`, `scripts/lib/**`, and `scripts/utilities/**` (shell doc sources). Editing only `.github/workflows/*` runs bazel-core (and gate), not hermetic/docs. Shared setup: `.github/actions/setup-bazel` (pinned Bazelisk + disk/repo + lint-tool caches). See `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml`, and `.bazelrc` (`--config=ci`)."},"118":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-116","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#validation-discipline-used-during-development","content":"Use queries heavily:"},"119":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-117","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#ci","content":"See `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (path-filtered jobs + `validate-gate`). **bazel-core** is authoritative for hermetic core tests; docs Playwright runs only in **docs-and-render** (not duplicated in bazel-core)."},"120":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-118","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#ci","content":"Use `--config=ci` on CI runners (higher `--jobs`, `--remote_download_minimal`)."},"121":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-119","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#ci","content":"The classic make-based paths remain for compatibility/legacy."},"122":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-120","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#ci","content":"For Gitea: see gitea-ci-setup.md and `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml` (self-hosted runners + persistent cache volumes recommended)."},"123":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-121","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#ci","content":"Bazel jobs restore disk/repo cache via `.github/actions/setup-bazel` (keyed on `MODULE.bazel.lock` + `.bazelversion`)."},"124":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-122","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"Never commit real `ansible/inventory/hosts.ini` (it is gitignored)."},"125":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-123","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"Kubeconfig, tokens, and SSH material are excluded."},"126":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-124","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"The BATS tests mock external commands (including kubectl) so they never touch real clusters or credentials."},"127":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-125","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"Bazel runfiles + explicit data dependencies make exactly what is needed visible (no accidental leakage of host files)."},"128":{"id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL-126","page_id":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL","tags":["bazel","testing","documentation","devcontainer"],"type":"text","url":"/BUILDING_WITH_BAZEL#security-notes","content":"`MODULE.bazel.lock` is committed (standard for reproducible Bzlmod) and contains only publi