**Contribute** — dev environment, Bazel"},"195":{"id":"/CONTRIBUTING-32","page_id":"/CONTRIBUTING","tags":["documentation","contributing","fumadocs","nextjs","bazel"],"type":"text","url":"/CONTRIBUTING#information-architecture","content":"Every major section has an `index.md`. Keep existing published slugs (`getting-started`,\n`architecture`, …): the route is the file path without its extension, so renaming a file\nbreaks every bookmark and README link to it. Put **new** pages under `start/`, `learn/`,\n`concepts/`, `operate/`, `contribute/`."},"196":{"id":"/CONTRIBUTING-33","page_id":"/CONTRIBUTING","tags":["documentation","contributing","fumadocs","nextjs","bazel"],"type":"text","url":"/CONTRIBUTING#information-architecture","content":"A new page needs three things or it will not appear in the sidebar and the coverage gate\nfails: the file under `docs/`, an entry in the nav (see above), and a listing in\n`_HAND_WRITTEN_MD` in `docs/BUILD.bazel` so Bazel ships it as a runfile."},"197":{"id":"/CONTRIBUTING-34","page_id":"/CONTRIBUTING","tags":["documentation","contributing","fumadocs","nextjs","bazel"],"type":"text","url":"/CONTRIBUTING#information-architecture","content":"Use the right-hand ToC for long pages. Keep navigation focused."},"198":{"id":"/CONTRIBUTING-35","page_id":"/CONTRIBUTING","tags":["documentation","contributing","fumadocs","nextjs","bazel"],"type":"text","url":"/CONTRIBUTING#content-guidelines","content":"Every page must open (after the title or any intentional top widget such as the interactive panel) with a scannable overview in this bullet-point format:\n**What's on this page**"},"199":{"id":"/CONTRIBUTING-36","page_id":"/CONTRIBUTING","tags":["documentation","contributing","fumadocs","nextjs","bazel"],"type":"text","url":"/CONTRIBUTING#content-guidelines","content":"Bullets describing the main content, sections, diagrams, tables, etc.\n**What this enables / practical use**"},"200":{"id":"/CONTRIBUTING-37","page_id":"/CONTRIBUTING","tags":["do