#differences-from-github","content":"Caching: mount persistent volumes for Bazel disk/repo caches; use `actions/cache` for npm/pip/Playwright when supported."},"842":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-57","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#differences-from-github","content":"Docs **publish** stays on GitHub Pages unless you add a separate Gitea deploy workflow."},"843":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-58","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Use the shipped `.gitea/workflows/ci.yml` (do not regress to a single job)."},"844":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-59","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Self-hosted runners (`gitea-act-runner` or compatible): mount persistent volume for `~/.cache/bazel-disk` and `~/.cache/bazel-repo` (and node\\_modules) for large cache hits across builds (key on `MODULE.bazel.lock` / `.bazelversion`)."},"845":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-60","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Use `actions/cache` for the same keys as GitHub where the runner supports it."},"846":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-61","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Runner labels: configure in Gitea admin (e.g. `self-hosted`, `linux`); use in `runs-on`."},"847":{"id":"/gitea-ci-setup-62","page_id":"/gitea-ci-setup","tags":["ci","gitea","forgejo","bazel","github-actions"],"type":"text","url":"/gitea-ci-setup#recommended-rollout-for-gitea-ultra-optimized","content":"Keep `.