ma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"`google/medgemma-27b-multimodal`, FP8 on `cu130-nightly`"},"1211":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-54","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"`lab-med`, `lab-med-vision`"},"1212":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-55","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Mode A is TP=1. The ring is unused for tokens. 35B is pinned to spark0 **only** via the rounded overlay so 1-node exclusive/dual still works."},"1213":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-56","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next: start `max-model-len` 65536; document 262144. Prefix caching off. PLE mmap is mandatory."},"1214":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-57","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"`--quality` loads existing `qwen3.6-27b-nvfp4` on spark2 (`lab-quality`). `lab-med` then falls back to `lab-smart` with a medical system prompt (not MedGemma)."},"1215":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-58","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Optional `medgemma-4b` sidecar (`lab-med-extract`) is **off by default**. Enable only after Resource Guard says there is GPU headroom. Never treat 4B as the only medical model."},"1216":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-59","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-a--daily-mixed-fleet-default","content":"Documented Apache-2 swap if HAI-DEF is a problem: Baichuan-M2-32B (docs only). Do not default to OpenBioLLM-8B or Meditron-7B."},"1217":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-60","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-b--exclusive-frontier-uses-the-ring","content":"`glm-5.3-flash` leader on spark0 + workers on spark1/spark2. Image `glm53-flash-tp3:local` built on Spark from the published TP=3 overlay (stock nightly cannot do TP=3). Checkpoint `local-inference-lab/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4` (or RedHatAI). MTP default; DFlash2 is CC BY-NC-ND and is not the default."},"1218":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-61","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#mode-b--exclusive-frontier-uses-the-ring","content":"`start-stack-rounded`, `start-glm53-flash`, and `start-dsv41-flash` refuse each other. Heavy confirm. `lab-frontier` stays GLM; `lab-med` falls back to `lab-smart`, then `lab-frontier`, then `lab-frontier-ds` with an explicit prompt that MedGemma is offline and this is a general model."},"1219":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-62","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#recover-when-modes-collide","content":"`bazelisk run //:manage -- status-stack` — see 